{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0324_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f94f36b599cd78750972b0e1772da04c7fc89243afa90ed1a5c2b37f8768b52b", "ja": "（今日は莉緒の新曲のPV撮影だ。\n莉緒の表情が印象的で、素敵な映像が撮れた！）", "zh": "（今天是莉绪拍摄新歌PV的日子。莉绪的表情令人印象深刻，拍出了很棒的影像！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0324_1001_046rio", "source_sha256": "ee4133e3ecf527bf66ec1b4013d92f9b11c82420c49e14e5c1f8cba001e6cf65", "ja": "{$P$}くん！　今の、どうだった？\n私的にはいい表情ができたと思うんだけど……。", "zh": "{$P$}！刚才那段怎么样？\n我觉得自己刚才的表情挺不错的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0324_1002_p", "source_sha256": "dc9a15c1838e2719d162ca0c1aafcb9f71febb18fef5e2ebecf60a29f2bd1c01", "ja": "お疲れ様、莉緒。\nああ、すごいよかったよ！", "zh": "辛苦了，莉绪。\n啊，拍得特别好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0324_1003_046rio", "source_sha256": "281f659ef9734e79cfddeda76b953f741181fe6c7d48f030787a49539b279843", "ja": "やった～♪　えっと、それでなんだけど……\n今日の撮影、どんなところが特によかった？", "zh": "太好了～♪　那个，我想问的是……\n今天的拍摄，哪些地方特别棒？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0324_1004_p", "source_sha256": "b66f9f0a8ab8222f68f37d4ae0b6049f161cd043509fc3399de3aecf9b6d9a50", "ja": "よかったところ？　……そうだな。中盤にあった\n恋する女の子のいじらしい表情、かな。", "zh": "好的地方？……我想想。大概是中间那段\n恋爱少女楚楚可怜的神情吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0324_1005_046rio", "source_sha256": "3ef6bee985cbdf63ff4a7bfd657451e26262a7730030bd15ef71be1e6b7e3f0e", "ja": "やっぱり！？\nさすが{$P$}くん、わかってるわね！", "zh": "果然是吗！？\n真不愧是{$P$}，很懂嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0324_1006_046rio", "source_sha256": "7ecd035fd70c0c4ab83c69573a26657d52295296e17d7cbe7148233c7ec313e3", "ja": "あのシーンは、特別に気持ちを込めたの。\n恋する気持ちって、とっても複雑で難しいわ。", "zh": "那一幕，我可是特别倾注了心意哦。\n恋爱的心情，真的是既复杂又难懂呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0324_1007_046rio", "source_sha256": "2636766f1d4e21752366a30c51c6da02842cbb834e0d89b9d25142077d426997", "ja": "好きと嫌いの間で揺れたり、急に不安になったり……\nでも愛しくて。そんな気持ちが届いたらいいなって。", "zh": "在喜欢与讨厌之间摇摆不定，或是突然感到不安……\n但又觉得惹人怜爱。要是能把这份心情传达出去就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0324_1008_p", "source_sha256": "628e8bd29a20f4fe455bc204dc4e9920758e7b8bedcf1a767f9520bf5679c471", "ja": "そうだったのか。\n大丈夫。莉緒の気持ちは、ちゃんと届くよ。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。\n没关系，莉绪的心意一定能好好传达给他的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0324_1009_046rio", "source_sha256": "072d7aa844721fbe59cebd459b706f131a7496071c7b9e84195af9413edb9a42", "ja": "……そうよね。\nうん。きっと、あの人も私に恋しちゃうわよね♪", "zh": "……也是呢。\n嗯。那个人肯定也会爱上我的吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0324_1010_p", "source_sha256": "6979588f52496e9ffb608e7f225921e93335b5866ad75996a77d582705ba6795", "ja": "えっ？　あの人？", "zh": "咦？那个人？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0324_1011_046rio", "source_sha256": "edda4995be9dff510a79d92eeb6dc3b91e045c36d5db4646828fa00c2e92a212", "ja": "そうよ？　私の気持ち、あの人に届けーって。\n……ちなみに。キミはあの人の正体、わかった？", "zh": "没错呀？就是想把我的心意传达给那个人——\n……顺便问一下。你知道那个人的真实身份吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0324_1012_p", "source_sha256": "c7375fb6516309ad84e7c3a1aca5d9c69e1228bfe234ca452af40fb3e167d9db", "ja": "いや、わからないけど……。\n俺の知ってる人か？", "zh": "不，我不知道……\n是我认识的人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0324_1013_046rio", "source_sha256": "3d3877e4152ecf35e11253553be655273e2bc32b70ebd46ccaf18a35bad3a241", "ja": "もう～！　全然届いてないじゃなーいっ！\n{$P$}くんのおたんこなす～！", "zh": "真是的～！完全没传达到嘛——！\n{$P$}大笨蛋～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0324_1014_p", "source_sha256": "2a86ab7ec97d4f7a29685ee8008240786aab4c0ecb36761e0992e896d61f3342", "ja": "莉緒……！？", "zh": "莉绪……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0324_1015_046rio", "source_sha256": "4c44c62cfa20d65bf503e837cf6a2fb913333415aa64c63884ba82041263380e", "ja": "ううっ。私の表現力が全然足りないってことよね。\nもっと目線や身体の動きにセクシーさを出して……。", "zh": "呜呜，这就说明我的表现力完全不够吧。\n得让眼神和身体动作更性感一些……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0324_1016_046rio", "source_sha256": "9103948655c939ec36873f6ef96c4365c7e4bcc40ff03f29f81b8df993688ba9", "ja": "ねえ、{$P$}くん！\n今から撮り直してもらうことってできるかしら！？", "zh": "喂，{$P$}先生！现在可以请你帮我重新拍一遍吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0324_1017_p", "source_sha256": "3e6e8cc5569c5016aaabb84466642257ebfbfaf8d8c18bc10e1ec3c687530a79", "ja": "落ち着け、莉緒！　さっきので全然魅力的だから！\n莉緒の表情を見て、ドキッとしない人はいない！", "zh": "冷静点，莉緒！刚才那个镜头完全很有魅力！看到莉緒那个表情，没有人不会心跳加速的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0324_1018_046rio", "source_sha256": "ebec4e2dc86ebb823174c1da7f47e3adeb860f45d84308b5d57a8818683f0ee8", "ja": "……{$P$}くんも？\n私を見て、ドキッとしてくれた？", "zh": "……{$P$}也一样吗？\n看着我的时候，心跳加速了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0324_1019", "source_sha256": "d7dc2c584dab1c79c1051244bd1990da52c55f4f5fffd94bd0097c76a51bd1ca", "ja": "もちろん！", "zh": "那当然！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0324_2000_p", "source_sha256": "ecdf823a2a0695a23ff2c16662737bc3ed52c8ee5b73d91ecd961959490e4c23", "ja": "ああ。もちろん、ドキッとしたよ。\nそれに……少し羨ましいと思った。", "zh": "啊。当然会心头一跳。\n而且……我还觉得有点羡慕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0324_2001_046rio", "source_sha256": "648e28ac5651ea0f317ea6a6e93d0c9b8a89e637677bc0569f061693d85faf3c", "ja": "えっ？　それって……。", "zh": "诶？那就是说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0324_2002_p", "source_sha256": "f0228aa52fe9facfa3450eee15815742e80a80187680492bc04b8ba3d9701806", "ja": "莉緒みたいな素敵な女性に、あんなに想われてるなんて\n相手の人は幸せだなってな。", "zh": "能被莉緒这样出色的女性如此深情地爱着，\n那个人真的很幸福啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0324_2003_046rio", "source_sha256": "863bb02f7bd3e2698ebc30c37ce89928759f47f8731821706baa128f90f58c26", "ja": "……そうね。\nその誰かさんは、すごく幸せ者かもしれないわね。", "zh": "……也是呢。\n那个所谓的人，说不定确实是个超级幸运儿呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0324_2004_046rio", "source_sha256": "8630a7aaf1445a71bf4d02a8b1c565a02e03abdb65597df5e90ae4cebcfb9a31", "ja": "でも、まだまだ私の気持ちは伝わってないみたい……。\n次はひとりの女の子として、ドキッとさせてみせるわ。", "zh": "但是，看来我的心意还没有完全传达给他……  \n接下来，我会以一个女孩子的身份，让他心动给你看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
